epalive-blocker.md, TASK-260715-1ozsb6_third-public-api-blocker.md, TASK-260715-1af33i_adapter-api-blocker.md, TASK-260715-1af33i_window-gap-test-01.log, and TASK-260715-28ok1k_ssh-engine-candidate-audit.md.\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- Initial required status command: exit 1 because estimate was required; set Fibonacci estimate 5, then status transition exit 0.\\n- Baseline focused SSH suite: exit 0, 12 tests.\\n- First strict format gate: exit 1; formatted the two reported expressions. Final strict recursive Swift format: exit 0.\\n- First post-policy-split compile: exit 1 for one missing test-helper return; fixed.\\n- Final focused SSH suite: exit 0, 13 tests.\\n- git diff --check: exit 0.\\n- check-core-boundaries.sh: exit 0.\\n- make validate-core: exit 0; native/libssh2 verification passed, 336 tests in 29 suites passed, swift build passed.\\n- task-board validate: command exit 0 and reports PARENT_STATUS_MISMATCH for STORY-260715-lkshfz because unfinished hard blocker STORY-260715-l2i2oo suppresses parent promotion while this leaf is development. No dependency was bypassed; anomaly recorded in LOGBOOK.md.\\n\\nNo external blocker remains. Ready for developer-to-review handoff.\")'" in /Users/iv/Developer/relux-tunnel
